'The Standard Spa Miami Beach',
'Venetian Islands',
'Rooftop Bar',
'Perched on a converted 1950s motel on the Venetian Causeway, The Standard has spent two decades being the right kind of low-key. The rooftop hammam terrace, the mud lounge, and the pool scene are all decidedly anti-South Beach — which is exactly why the right people keep coming back. The après-spa crowd at the bar is more interesting than anything on Collins Avenue.',
