('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'1 Hotel South Beach',
'South Beach',
'Hotel Lobby',
'Barry Sternlicht''s eco-luxury property on Collins Avenue is what happens when the environment is the aesthetic, not an afterthought. Living walls, reclaimed wood, surfboards as lobby art — it reads like a mood board for the sustainably-minded wealthy. The Watr rooftop pool deck has a strong claim as the best hotel view in South Beach. The crowd is media, wellness, and tech money.',
