('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Institute of Contemporary Art Miami',
'Design District',
'Art World',
'Aranguren & Gallegos''s glass pavilion is the Design District''s cultural anchor — free admission always, programming that consistently outpaces the institution''s modest size. The ICA takes risks that PAMM occasionally can''t afford to. The garden cafe is underrated. The crowd on opening nights is a curated mix of artists, gallerists, and collectors who prefer substance to spectacle — which, in Miami, is the rarest combination.',
