('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Design District Palm Court',
'Design District',
'Luxury Retail',
'The Design District''s central gathering point is an open-air luxury shopping campus that makes Beverly Hills feel provincial. Palm Court''s canopy of mosaic palm trees — a permanent installation by Bertrand Lamarche — provides the backdrop for runway boutiques, gallery spaces, and the kind of people-watching that requires no commentary. Arrive in the afternoon. Walk slowly. The point is not what you buy.',
