('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Brickell City Centre',
'Brickell',
'Luxury Retail',
'Arquitectonica''s climate-ribbon shopping complex brought an entirely different energy to Brickell''s financial corridor — polished, accessible luxury rather than South Beach excess. Saks Fifth Avenue anchors the retail, but the real draw is the dining floor and the rooftop Happy Wine bar crowd. The clientele is the new Miami professional class: Latin American finance, tech, and the young wealthy who live in the surrounding towers.',
