('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'The Edition Miami Beach',
'Mid-Beach',
'Hotel Lobby',
'Ian Schrager''s most restrained Miami property sits inside a restored 1955 building and operates as a rebuttal to the excess of the surrounding competition. The lobby is spare and perfect. Matador — the basement nightclub — is genuinely difficult to get into. The pool deck, ice rink, and bowling alley underground create a private world that has little to do with the beach outside. The crowd skews fashion and international money.',
