('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Mandarin Oriental Miami',
'Brickell Key',
'Hotel Lobby',
'Marooned on Brickell Key — a private island in Biscayne Bay — the Mandarin Oriental operates as Miami''s most quietly serious luxury hotel. The bay views from the pool and Brickell Key Steak are among the best in the city. The clientele is corporate luxury and visiting dignitaries rather than fashionistas. The spa consistently ranks among the best in North America. Arrive via the causeway as if you own a unit in the building across the street.',
