('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Acqualina Resort & Residences',
'Sunny Isles Beach',
'Weekend Aristocrat',
'Sunny Isles''s answer to the ultra-luxury European resort. Acqualina''s Mediterranean architecture, three pools, and Aquanox spa have made it the preferred address for Latin American and Eastern European wealth that wants privacy over fashion week adjacency. The ESPA spa is world-class. The beach is controlled and quiet. The clientele ranges from legitimately famous to legitimately wealthy — frequently both.',
