('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Eden Roc Miami Beach',
'Mid-Beach',
'Hotel Lobby',
'Morris Lapidus''s other masterpiece — the Fontainebleau''s rival since 1956. The Eden Roc''s volcanic rock grotto pool and the NOBU EDEN ROC restaurant give it a distinctly more dramatic personality than its neighbour. The celebrity clientele that used to book Sammy Davis Jr. and Marlene Dietrich now books differently but no less deliberately. The rooftop gym has an unobstructed ocean view that makes every workout feel cinematic.',
