('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Nobu Hotel Miami Beach',
'Mid-Beach',
'Continental',
'Nobu Matsuhisa''s hotel and restaurant concept entered Miami at the Eden Roc and brought with it the precisely calibrated combination of Japanese minimalism and global celebrity that defines the brand. The Nobu Miami menu is the full expression — black cod miso, yellowtail jalapeño, sake programme — delivered in a room that manages to feel intimate despite its size. The crowd is deliberate: entertainment industry, international business, people who eat at Nobu in every city.',
