('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Sugar Rooftop at EAST Miami',
'Brickell',
'Rooftop Bar',
'On the 40th floor of the EAST Miami hotel in Brickell, Sugar is the city''s reigning rooftop. The Brickell skyline and bay views are unmatched at this elevation; the cocktail programme is one of the most serious in Miami; the crowd from Thursday through Saturday is the financial and creative class that lives in the surrounding towers and treats this as their living room. The golden retriever energy stops at the lift doors.',
