('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003',
'Sweet Liberty Drinks & Supply Co.',
'Miami Beach',
'Continental',
'John Lermayer''s Miami Beach institution — winner of more World''s Best Bar recognition than any other address in Florida — operates without the pretension those awards might suggest. Sweet Liberty is genuinely welcoming: the bar team knows the classics and the originals equally, the crowd mixes industry people with anyone who knows to come here, and the late-night energy is pure Miami without the velvet rope. Go for a Daiquiri. Stay for three hours.',
