'Komodo',
'Brickell',
'Power Lunch',
'David Grutman''s five-floor Brickell destination is the most transacted power-dining room in Miami. Asian-inspired menu, rooftop lounge, and a calendar that aligns with every significant business visit to the city. The first floor at lunch is where deals get made between the second and main courses. The rooftop on weekends belongs to a different crowd. Both have the same dress code: arrive looking like you can afford to be there.',
