'Watson Island',
'Weekend Aristocrat',
'On Watson Island between downtown and South Beach, Joia Beach is the city''s most scenically situated beach club — Biscayne Bay on one side, Miami skyline on the other, with the causeway traffic invisible from the sand. The food programme is better than expected. The day-bed situation requires advance booking. The crowd is a genuine cross-section of Miami pleasure-seekers who discovered the spot before it became fully stratified.',
